<title>USA: Fifth Third Capital Trust I issues cap securities.</title>
<headline>Fifth Third Capital Trust I issues cap securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following $200 million issue from Fifth Third Capital Trust I was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER FIFTH THIRD CAPITAL TRUST I</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	  COUPON  08.136    MATURITY 03/15/27</p>
<p>TYPE CAP SECURITIES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S  A1    YIELD   08.136    PAY FREQ</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P	A     SPREAD  110 BPS   CALLABLE 10 YRS</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1675))</p>
</text>
